  "conclusion": "No signed-depth, key-follow, filter-type, slope or bypass import mismatch found. All six tone blocks agree byte-for-byte between shipping PluginProcessor import and the actual standalone readCompletePatch loader. Matching initialization and a fixed note60/velocity100 plus note-off render produced exactly zero sample difference for all three patches. The cutoff-Hz, envelope depth-to-octaves, envelope time and response topology remain model assumptions, not independently calibrated hardware laws.",
